Project Demonstration Phase

ComicCraft-AI – Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

The Project Demonstration Phase is the stage where the completed ComicCraft-AI system is presented and demonstrated to users, teachers, or project evaluators. The main purpose is to show the working features of the application and explain how Gemini models are used to create comic stories.

1. Introduction

The project demonstration begins with a brief introduction to ComicCraft-AI. It is an AI-powered comic story creation application that uses Gemini models to transform a user's simple idea into a complete comic story.

2. Demonstration Steps

Step 1 – Open the Application
Launch the ComicCraft-AI application and display the home page.

Step 2 – Create a New Comic
Select "Create New Comic" and enter the required details.

Step 3 – Enter Story Idea
Enter a simple prompt, for example:

> "Create a superhero comic about a college student who discovers a magical power."



Step 4 – Select Preferences
Select:

Genre

Number of characters

Story length

Number of comic panels

Story setting


Step 5 – Generate Story
Click the Generate button. The application sends the user's request to the Gemini model.

Step 6 – Display AI Output
Gemini generates:

Comic title

Story

Characters

Scenes

Dialogues

Captions

Panel descriptions


Step 7 – Preview Comic
The generated content is displayed panel by panel in the comic preview section.

Step 8 – Edit and Regenerate
The user can edit the generated story or request Gemini to regenerate a particular scene or dialogue.

Step 9 – Save the Comic
The completed comic project can be saved for future editing.

Step 10 – Export the Final Comic
The final comic can be exported or presented as the project output.

3. Main Features Demonstrated

Feature	Demonstration

Story Generation	Generate a story from a simple prompt
Character Creation	Create detailed characters
Scene Generation	Generate different comic scenes
Dialogue Generation	Generate character conversations
Panel Creation	Divide the story into comic panels
AI Regeneration	Regenerate unsatisfactory content
Editing	Modify generated content
Save	Store the completed project
Export	Produce the final comic


4. Gemini Model Demonstration

The demonstration explains the role of Gemini in the system:

User Prompt → Backend → Gemini Model → Generated Content → ComicCraft-AI Interface

For example, when the user enters a superhero story idea, Gemini processes the prompt and generates a structured story containing characters, scenes, dialogues, and captions.

5. Expected Demonstration Output

At the end of the demonstration, the evaluator should be able to see a complete comic story consisting of:

Title → Characters → Story → Scenes → Dialogues → Comic Panels → Final Preview

6. Conclusion

The demonstration phase proves that ComicCraft-AI – Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models can successfully convert user ideas into creative and structured comic stories. It highlights the system's AI capabilities, user-friendly interface, editing features, and overall functionality.
